DialogueLibrary: {
	DryadArrival: {
		Briefing: {
			Line1.Text: ...Did you see that?[] The way it pulled the Eye apart, piece by piece.
			Line2.Text: That wasn't the Eye's doing.[] Something took what was left of it.[] And I'm afraid I know exactly what it is...
			Line3.Text: I've read about it, once.[] Apathia.[] It's an ancient form of magic, dangerous at that.
			Line4.Text: It nullifies anything it gets a hold of.[] And with the Eye gone, it's back in the world.
			Line5.Text: Don't look at me like that![] I'm not going to leave you to face it alone.
			Line6.Text: In fact, I know someone who can help.[] A friend of mine,[] from another world entirely.[] She's on her way,[] so be kind to her.
		}

		Greeting: {
			Line1.Text: Forgive the entrance.[] Crossing over is never gentle.
			Line2.Text: So you're the one [speakerName:Guide] told me about.[] [speakerName:player], yes?
			Line3.Text: I felt the seal break the moment it was loosened.[] Even from Ingress, I you can feel it's darkness echoing.
			Line4.Text: "this isn't something can't be fought, at least not the way you're used to.[] But it can be mitigated,[] and that is what I can teach you to do."
			Line5.Text: Give me a little time to settle in.[] Then come and find me,[] and we'll see what can be done.
		}

		ReturnToTown.Line1.Text: Where did you wander off to?[] She'll be arriving any moment now,[] and I'd rather you were in town to meet her.
	}
}
